        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Dy(SCN)3·6H2O (0.2 mmol) was treated with H3L_RRRRRR (0.05 mmol) in methanol (15 mL) in the presence of Et3N (0.2 mmol). The mixture was stirred at room temperature for 2 h and left unperturbed for slow solvent evaporation. Colorless single crystals of R-Dy3 formed after a few days.",
        "reagents": [
          {
            "name": "dysprosium(III) thiocyanate hexahydrate",
