      },
      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "both",
        "summary": "Enantiopure triangular Dy3 cluster showing optical activity (mirror-image CD/VCD versus S-Dy3) and field-induced SMM behavior. Dc χMT indicates intramolecular ferromagnetic Dy–Dy coupling below 40 K. Under 300 Oe, frequency-dependent ac maxima give Ueff = 37 K and τ0 = 5×10^-8 s; applied fields slow QTM and reveal two closely spaced relaxation processes above ~900 Oe.",
